cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the thesis it belongs to."
title: "mammo-iq-metrics: image quality metrics and parametrised degradations for mammography"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible pipeline for computing image quality metrics on full-field digital mammograms
  and for applying parametrised image quality degradations (dose-motivated noise, directional
  motion blur, contrast compression, JPEG 2000 compression and spatial resolution reduction) at
  six severity levels each. Regions of interest and the intensity normalisation window are fixed
  on the undegraded image and reused for every degraded variant, so that metric changes are
  attributable to the degradation.
type: software
authors:
